It was packed with people a few days ago,

552
00:23:59,760 --> 00:24:00,640
and we were so busy.

553
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,720
Today there's no one,

554
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:02,720
and we're bored to death.

555
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:03,380
[Nurses' Station]

556
00:24:03,070 --> 00:24:03,690
I don't even know

557
00:24:03,690 --> 00:24:05,870
what kind of place
I've gotten myself into.

558
00:24:05,870 --> 00:24:07,510
After what happened a few days ago,

559
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:09,240
I'm afraid no one dares to come.

560
00:24:10,510 --> 00:24:11,720
Is Liu Zhengliang here?

561
00:24:11,720 --> 00:24:12,990
He's doing rounds inside.

562
00:24:12,990 --> 00:24:13,510
Okay.

563
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,550
Why is he here again?

564
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,680
He said he's looking for Dr. Liu.

565
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,280
I don't know what's going on.

566
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,160
Why did he bring the police?

567
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:27,960
I don't know.

568
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:32,510
Dr. Liu.

569
00:24:36,260 --> 00:24:38,140
[Keep the ward clean and tidy]

570
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,610
Why are you here again?

571
00:24:37,830 --> 00:24:39,630
Aren't the autopsy results out?

572
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:40,760
My sister died of

573
00:24:40,760 --> 00:24:42,070
an overdose of Tripterygium wilfordii.

574
00:24:41,150 --> 00:24:48,940
[No smoking]

575
00:24:43,070 --> 00:24:46,130
Xiaoximen Hospital bears
only minor responsibility.

576
00:24:47,310 --> 00:24:48,910
I'm here to apologize today.

577
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:52,440
When my parents passed away,

578
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:54,720
my sis was only 20.

579
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:56,550
I was only 13 then.

580
00:24:57,760 --> 00:24:59,920
My sis raised me.

581
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,480
I just wanted my sis

582
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,590
to live a good life.

583
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:05,870
I used my own methods.

584
00:25:05,870 --> 00:25:07,440
I worked hard, and I did it.

585
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:10,310
My sis didn't enjoy it for long

586
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:12,400
before she was gone!

587
00:25:12,790 --> 00:25:14,200
She was only 45.

588
00:25:14,310 --> 00:25:16,640
She didn't have any underlying diseases.

589
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,040
I couldn't figure it out.

590
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:20,960
I just wanted

591
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:22,620
to find someone

592
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:25,560
to take responsibility for my sis's death.

593
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:28,160
That's why I wronged you.

594
00:25:29,070 --> 00:25:29,870
I'm sorry.

595
00:25:30,510 --> 00:25:31,760
I caused you trouble.

596
00:25:38,870 --> 00:25:39,800
My condolences.

597
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:43,350
Right, one more thing.

598
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,900
I really have to thank you.

599
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,640
If you hadn't insisted on an autopsy,

600
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:48,640
I really wouldn't have known

601
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:50,240
that my brother-in-law

602
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,270
poisoned my sis.

603
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:54,390
Actually, I noticed long ago

604
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:55,310
that something was wrong with him.

605
00:25:55,310 --> 00:25:56,030
Shao Yang.

606
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:58,310
The case hasn't been fully
investigated yet.

607
00:25:58,310 --> 00:25:59,400
Where did you get that conclusion?

608
00:25:59,400 --> 00:25:59,960
No.

609
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,200
He admitted it himself.

610
00:26:02,310 --> 00:26:03,000
He said he had

611
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,110
another woman outside.

612
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:05,640
He was afraid of being found out.

613
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:06,790
He was afraid of leaving with nothing,

614
00:26:06,790 --> 00:26:08,000
so he did it.

615
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,820
You insisted on seeing Dr. Liu

616
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:11,790
before telling us
Jiang Chao's whereabouts.

617
00:26:11,790 --> 00:26:12,320
Alright,

618
00:26:12,400 --> 00:26:13,440
now you've seen him

619
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,440
and talked to him,

620
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:15,720
you can tell us

621
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:17,490
where Jiang Chao is now, right?

622
00:26:20,110 --> 00:26:20,920
Shao Yang.

623
00:26:21,790 --> 00:26:22,590
Shao Yang!

624
00:26:23,550 --> 00:26:24,640
You can't do this!

625
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:25,870
You can't!

626
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:28,090
Shao Yang, listen to me.

627
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,590
Don't! Don't!

628
00:26:31,270 --> 00:26:32,600
It's not what you think!

629
00:26:33,590 --> 00:26:35,030
Shao Yang, I beg you!

630
00:26:37,830 --> 00:26:40,110
In my warehouse in the western suburbs.

631
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,200
I'm sorry

632
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,640
for causing you trouble.

633
00:27:23,110 --> 00:27:23,970
Stop fighting!

634
00:27:46,190 --> 00:27:52,350
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

635
00:28:04,350 --> 00:28:05,510
Let me tell you again.

636
00:28:05,510 --> 00:28:07,200
My mom just called me again.

637
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:08,440
She asked me

638
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:11,320
when I'd bring Zhengliang home for dinner.

639
00:28:11,510 --> 00:28:12,480
I'm very angry.

640
00:28:14,110 --> 00:28:15,110
I just can't figure out

641
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,440
why she cares so much about you

642
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:18,200
and not me.

643
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:24,110
Do you think Jiang Chao poisoned her?

644
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,640
Could it be that

645
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,770
Shao Yang beat a confession out of him?

646
00:28:28,270 --> 00:28:29,430
Otherwise, he wouldn't have

647
00:28:29,430 --> 00:28:30,510
so easily

648
00:28:30,510 --> 00:28:32,920
signed the autopsy consent form.

649
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:35,110
Could it be that

650
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:36,690
he took a chance,

651
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,720
thinking that...

652
00:28:41,270 --> 00:28:42,480
chronic poisoning

653
00:28:44,590 --> 00:28:46,590
wouldn't be detected in an autopsy?

654
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:48,200
If that's really the case,

655
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,270
when Shao Yang hit him,

656
00:28:49,270 --> 00:28:51,200
he should have beaten him to death.

657
00:28:51,550 --> 00:28:52,790
But I have to say,

658
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:54,400
that kid Shao Yang

659
00:28:55,030 --> 00:28:55,870
is a real man.

660
00:28:57,590 --> 00:28:59,120
Before the police arrived,

661
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,480
he tied him up.

662
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:02,920
He is a real man.

663
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:03,640
But tell me,

664
00:29:07,070 --> 00:29:08,130
he's so young;

665
00:29:08,150 --> 00:29:09,950
isn't he ruining his own future?

666
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,110
What are you doing?

667
00:29:15,110 --> 00:29:16,370
Playing on your phone?

668
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:20,400
I'm listening.

669
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,810
What did you hear me say?

670
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:30,930
[Meituan Group-Buy Deals]

671
00:29:30,870 --> 00:29:31,760
Group buying?

672
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,400
You're quite frugal.

673
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:39,190
Are you treating me to a meal?

674
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:42,450
I want to treat everyone to a meal.

675
00:29:44,110 --> 00:29:46,030
Could you help me tell everyone?

676
00:29:48,310 --> 00:29:49,920
Treating everyone to a meal?

677
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,310
Did the sun rise

678
00:29:51,310 --> 00:29:52,440
from the west today?

679
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:54,440
Sure, no problem.

680
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,360
Who are you inviting?

681
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:06,130
[Flower of Wealth] [KTV]

682
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:04,680
Hello, welcome.

683
00:30:12,760 --> 00:30:13,560
Keep singing.

684
00:30:16,350 --> 00:30:17,280
You startled me.

685
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:19,250
What are you doing here?

686
00:30:19,760 --> 00:30:21,760
Finding a time to treat you to a meal.

687
00:30:22,440 --> 00:30:24,310
You? Treating me?

688
00:30:25,510 --> 00:30:26,440
Not just you,

689
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:29,040
but also the colleagues
who helped me that day.

690
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:32,060
I'm working, so I don't have time.
I'm not going.

691
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,680
Okay, then help me

692
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,480
tell Ai Chen.

693
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,510
Did you never plan to invite me

694
00:30:37,510 --> 00:30:38,640
from the start?

695
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:41,200
You said yourself you didn't have time.

696
00:30:41,350 --> 00:30:42,750
And then you just gave up?

697
00:30:42,870 --> 00:30:44,200
Couldn't you ask again?

698
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:46,640
Are you coming or not?

699
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:47,830
No, I don't have time.

700
00:30:47,830 --> 00:30:49,690
Okay, then help me invite Ai Chen.

701
00:30:50,550 --> 00:30:52,160
Go tell her yourself.

702
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:54,140
I don't have her phone number.

703
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,480
Going to her place from the hospital

704
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:57,010
is closer than coming here.

705
00:30:57,550 --> 00:30:58,510
Cut the crap.

706
00:30:58,550 --> 00:31:00,080
Are you going to help or not?

707
00:31:00,510 --> 00:31:01,960
Zhengguang, send a bottle of beer to V3.

708
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:02,790
And a fruit platter.

709
00:31:02,790 --> 00:31:03,550
Got it.

710
00:31:08,310 --> 00:31:09,400
I can help you,

711
00:31:10,310 --> 00:31:12,040
but you have to do me a favor too.

712
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:15,890
Then never mind.

713
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:19,440
Aren't you even going
to ask what the favor is?

714
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:20,720
Do I need to ask?

715
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:21,790
You just want me

716
00:31:21,790 --> 00:31:23,190
to go find Long Dongdong.

717
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,660
It's only 10 days in total.

718
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:27,760
You can't even stick with this?

719
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,110
It's not about that.

720
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:31,020
Then what is it?

721
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:39,940
I'm afraid Mom's soul will be scattered.

722
00:31:41,830 --> 00:31:42,790
What do you mean?

723
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:45,680
I've been feeling lately

724
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:47,080
that Mom is following me.

725
00:31:47,110 --> 00:31:48,640
The KTV's boss has a room,

726
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:50,160
covered in talismans.

727
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:51,240
It's terrifying.

728
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:53,170
I'm afraid if Mom runs into them...

729
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:09,590
Who let you

730
00:32:09,590 --> 00:32:10,720
harm our child?

731
00:32:10,830 --> 00:32:11,590
Who let you

732
00:32:11,590 --> 00:32:12,640
harm our child?

733
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:13,160
Who let you

734
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,450
harm our child?

735
00:32:14,510 --> 00:32:15,480
Get out of here!

736
00:32:15,480 --> 00:32:16,240
What's going on?

737
00:32:16,240 --> 00:32:16,480
Wait,

738
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:18,410
your child must be possessed!

739
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:20,350
I specially hired a shaman for you!

740
00:32:20,350 --> 00:32:22,440
This time he will definitely be cured!

741
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:23,240
Look at this!

742
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,070
What are you doing?

743
00:32:25,510 --> 00:32:26,200
Leave!

744
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:28,480
Our child is not possessed!

745
00:32:28,870 --> 00:32:29,870
He's not sick!

746
00:32:30,070 --> 00:32:31,270
If you dare bully our child again,

747
00:32:31,270 --> 00:32:32,440
I'll fight you to the death!

748
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,200
To the death!

749
00:32:33,350 --> 00:32:35,350
To the death!

750
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,410
Liu Zhengguang.

751
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,510
Mom hated this kind of

752
00:32:44,510 --> 00:32:46,440
superstitious nonsense the most.

753
00:32:47,240 --> 00:32:48,110
She's dead.

754
00:32:48,830 --> 00:32:50,110
Dead means gone.

755
00:32:50,110 --> 00:32:51,640
She doesn't exist anymore.

756
00:32:51,790 --> 00:32:53,030
She won't appear before us

757
00:32:53,030 --> 00:32:53,720
in any form

758
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,200
or shape.

759
00:32:56,590 --> 00:32:57,650
Do you understand?

760
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:23,300
What are you doing?

761
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:26,240
I saw your quilt was a bit damp.

762
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:27,770
So I'm airing it out for you.

763
00:33:34,070 --> 00:33:35,790
I hate superstitious nonsense the most.

764
00:33:35,790 --> 00:33:36,720
Don't you know that?

765
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:38,320
Are you trying to piss me off?

766
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,480
What else can I do?

767
00:33:41,510 --> 00:33:43,160
They all say your illness is incurable.

768
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:43,870
Can I just watch

769
00:33:43,870 --> 00:33:44,960
you wait to die?

770
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:48,200
Zhengguang, life and death are fated.

771
00:33:48,550 --> 00:33:51,000
People can't arm-wrestle
with the King of Hell.

772
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,920
Remember,

773
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,310
even if I pass away one day,

774
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:55,110
you can't believe in this stuff.

775
00:33:58,760 --> 00:34:00,760
You have to rely on your real family.

776
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:02,770
You and your brother

777
00:34:03,760 --> 00:34:05,390
must live your lives well.

778
00:34:09,270 --> 00:34:10,080
Understood.

779
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:14,790
If you want to quit,

780
00:34:15,080 --> 00:34:16,610
go tell your boss yourself.

781
00:34:19,429 --> 00:34:20,270
We'll see.

782
00:34:26,679 --> 00:34:28,409
Stop being so paranoid all day.

783
00:34:30,389 --> 00:34:32,120
I'm going back to the hospital.

784
00:34:37,870 --> 00:34:38,830
Send me the restaurant.

785
00:34:38,830 --> 00:34:40,290
I'll forward it to Ai Chen.

786
00:34:42,429 --> 00:34:43,239
Well...

787
00:34:44,909 --> 00:34:45,639
Why don't you

788
00:34:46,270 --> 00:34:47,800
go home for a couple of days?

789
00:34:48,639 --> 00:34:49,639
I've been a bit...

790
00:34:50,870 --> 00:34:51,639
lost lately.

791
00:35:03,830 --> 00:35:04,350
Hello.

792
00:35:04,390 --> 00:35:06,200
I bought a combo meal on Meituan.

793
00:35:06,240 --> 00:35:07,770
Okay, let me scan your code.

794
00:35:08,790 --> 00:35:09,720
Send it after editing.

795
00:35:09,720 --> 00:35:10,870
You know how to edit photos?

796
00:35:10,870 --> 00:35:11,790
My photo editing skills are amazing.

797
00:35:11,790 --> 00:35:12,520
Verified, Sir.

798
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,270
Thank you.

799
00:35:13,650 --> 00:35:21,560
[Pier One Waterfront Restaurant]

800
00:35:21,390 --> 00:35:22,520
Here's your food.

801
00:35:24,520 --> 00:35:25,670
Another free dish?

802
00:35:27,120 --> 00:35:27,830
Dr. Liu,

803
00:35:28,270 --> 00:35:30,040
we saw the news about you.

804
00:35:30,160 --> 00:35:30,600
You are now

805
00:35:30,600 --> 00:35:31,990
a celebrity in Fucheng.

806
00:35:32,120 --> 00:35:33,390
The fact that you still eat here

807
00:35:33,390 --> 00:35:34,790
makes me feel so honored.

808
00:35:35,560 --> 00:35:36,680
The combo meal you ordered

809
00:35:36,680 --> 00:35:37,760
is all served.

810
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,680
Although this combo

811
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:40,470
is quite cheap,

812
00:35:40,470 --> 00:35:43,200
I'll give you these two dishes for free.

813
00:35:43,470 --> 00:35:44,640
Don't be a stranger,

814
00:35:44,640 --> 00:35:45,640
and don't be so polite.

815
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:46,350
Don't worry.

816
00:35:46,350 --> 00:35:47,560
He won't be a stranger.

817
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:48,490
He's fitting in.

818
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:49,990
That's good.

819
00:35:50,080 --> 00:35:51,390
Okay, enjoy your meal.

820
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,310
Thank you.

821
00:35:52,310 --> 00:35:53,240
You're welcome.

822
00:35:55,200 --> 00:35:56,120
Of course he's fitting in.

823
00:35:56,120 --> 00:35:56,870
I remember Liu

824
00:35:56,870 --> 00:35:58,760
was scared to death

825
00:35:58,760 --> 00:35:59,990
the first time he saw me smoking this.

826
00:35:59,990 --> 00:36:00,790
Right?

827
00:36:01,120 --> 00:36:01,870
Let alone him,

828
00:36:01,870 --> 00:36:02,760
the first time I saw it,

829
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:03,470
I was scared too.

830
00:36:03,470 --> 00:36:04,310
Who wouldn't be scared?

831
00:36:04,310 --> 00:36:05,840
I almost called the police.

832
00:36:08,990 --> 00:36:10,720
Sorry I'm late.

833
00:36:11,390 --> 00:36:12,390
-You're here.
-Have a seat.

834
00:36:12,390 --> 00:36:13,320
Nice to meet you.

835
00:36:14,470 --> 00:36:15,520
Am I the last one?

836
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:16,200
No.

837
00:36:16,200 --> 00:36:17,270
-No.
-The dishes just arrived.

838
00:36:17,270 --> 00:36:18,400
We just got here too.

839
00:36:18,560 --> 00:36:19,520
We were waiting for you.

